{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LYpSayu5GQAKQsLfnp5j9r","type":"tool_result","content":"89\t## Non-Negotiable Product Properties\n90\t\n91\t- Local-first by default.\n92\t- Deterministic identities for every file, symbol, doc section, event, and memory.\n93\t- Every durable memory has evidence.\n94\t- Every retrieved memory has an inclusion reason.\n95\t- Every stale or contradicted memory is surfaced as such, not hidden behind recency.\n96\t- Every workflow bundle is compact by default with deliberate expansion handles.\n97\t- Every background consolidation pass is recoverable, replayable, and observable.\n98\t- Every public MCP contract is documented and regression-tested.\n99\t- No silent broad workspace reads that bypass ignore rules or workspace boundaries.\n100\t- No unbounded graph traversal, payload growth, or event-log scans on hot paths.\n101\t\n102\t## System Architecture\n103\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6bc825b2-855a-40f4-bda9-b6466b178977","uuid":"20d98028-a74e-48cd-a29f-8a9b856205d4","timestamp":"2026-05-17T09:21:12.880Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md","content":"## Non-Negotiable Product Properties\n\n- Local-first by default.\n- Deterministic identities for every file, symbol, doc section, event, and memory.\n- Every durable memory has evidence.\n- Every retrieved memory has an inclusion reason.\n- Every stale or contradicted memory is surfaced as such, not hidden behind recency.\n- Every workflow bundle is compact by default with deliberate expansion handles.\n- Every background consolidation pass is recoverable, replayable, and observable.\n- Every public MCP contract is documented and regression-tested.\n- No silent broad workspace reads that bypass ignore rules or workspace boundaries.\n- No unbounded graph traversal, payload growth, or event-log scans on hot paths.\n\n## System Archi